This framework-neutral renderer adapts the orthographic interaction, degree
scaling and focus behaviour of Narrative Goldmine's graph application:
https://github.com/jjohare/visionGraph/tree/main/publishing-tools/WasmVOWL/modern
The publisher's corpus, routing, stores and simulation remain in that repository.
The implementation uses browser Canvas APIs and has no third-party runtime
JavaScript dependency. Rust/WASM engine and codec notices are maintained in
Ontomark's THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and travel with their binary distributions:
https://github.com/DreamLab-AI/ontomark/blob/main/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
